+/* The table shell TableView and ArchiveView wear over the Tables chrome, ArchiveView importing it from here: shell width, grid density, hide/slide beat, and group-band rhythm. Values live in UIX/Table/table-tokens.css. */
 
-.table-view {
+.table-shell {
   /* Width is auto so the negative side margins widen the box to both glass edges while the grid's content box (and so every row) stays exactly where it was. */
